femticPy patch 0008-write_inversion_control-options

Rationale: write_inversion_control rounded CONVERGE ('%.1f': 0.25 -> 0.2) and TRADE_OFF/ALPHA ('%.2f': 0.001 -> 0.00), fixed BOTTOM_RESISTIVITY at 100 and could not write OWNER_ELEMENT; add both, print %.10g.

--- a/src/femticPy.py
+++ b/src/femticPy.py
@@ -522,7 +522,9 @@
                                 TRADE_OFF_PARAM = [3],
                                 ITERATION = 10,
                                 CONVERGE = 1.0,
-                                ALPHA_WEIGHT = [1,1,1]
+                                ALPHA_WEIGHT = [1,1,1],
+                                BOTTOM_RESISTIVITY = 100.0,   # [patch 0008]
+                                OWNER_ELEMENT = None          # [patch 0008] None: keyword not written
                                 ):
         file_loc = os.path.join(self.outdir, 'control.dat') 
         file = open(file_loc,'w', newline='\n')
@@ -539,30 +541,32 @@
